@*============================================================================
@* levelsettings.oas: the minimal settings holder
@*============================================================================
@*
@* A level that has no settings of its own places one object of this type so it
@* still offers the global settings (global_settings.inc: Show framerate). It
@* has no sheet of its own: everything it carries comes from settings.inc.
@* A level with its own holder (PlantedTankSettings, CuckooVillageSettings, ...)
@* does not need this type; it gets the global settings from settings.inc.
@* docs/plans/2026-11-22-global-level-settings.md.
@*============================================================================

TYPEHEADER(Level Settings,LevelSettings)
	@include settings.inc
	@include global_settings.inc
TYPEFOOTER
